			"date": "2025-12-05T20:43:54.427Z",
			"content": "<p>Folks can feel free to steal this (unfortunately JS) solution to calculate obtrusive scrollbar widths! <a href=\"https://github.com/zachleat/line-numbers/blob/dfdd9acf7499514b4845708d43b13aab98781bc8/line-numbers.js#L4-L16\">github.com/zachleat/lin...</a></p>\n<p>(originally from <a href=\"https://www.filamentgroup.com/lab/scrollbars/\">www.filamentgroup.com/lab/scrollba...</a> !)</p>",
