			"date": "2025-12-05T20:57:07.683Z",
			"content": "<p>\"there is no way I’ve found to make it not a white, or dark-in-dark-mode, bar\"</p>\n<p>I think it is dark if you've used color-scheme for your dark mode.</p>\n<p>But yeah even when the scrollbar was already there and just lost the moving bit, it sticks out so much when it's plain and empty and useless.</p>",
