			},
			"date": "2025-12-05T20:57:07.684Z",
			"content": "<p>Would be good if it would just take on whatever background or backdrop colour is already there, or if you could style it with the track part of scrollbar-color. But I guess it's technically not a scrollbar or a track at that point.</p>",
